    "training_evaluation": "Implement Stochastic Weight Averaging (SWA) by collecting model state dicts only from the top 3 best validation log loss epochs (instead of all epochs) and using a uniform average. This avoids the failed case where averaging poor checkpoints degraded performance. Additionally, increase gradient clipping to 0.5 (from 1.0) to improve stability, and reduce word dropout probability to 0.05 to prevent excessive masking that may harm learning. Keep early stopping patience at 3. The final inference will use the SWA averaged model. All other training parameters (lr, batch size, accumulation steps) remain unchanged as per the initial plan."
